	 * @example RunnerRegistry._cleanDirectoryField('masterDir', ' /srv/kb ') => '/srv/kb'
	 * @param {string} field - 'masterDir' or 'worktreeDir' (naming the error).
	 * @param {*} value - Supplied value.
